  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassFD1C8DE9B6E4454F9EABA78B430CB036\"><div><br>&#160;</div><ul><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/BMJ%20Nutrition%20and%20ECD%20Pakistan.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Multisector governance for nutrition and early childhood development&#58; overlapping agendas and differing progress in Pakistan\u200b</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Nutrition_Policy_in_the_Post-devolution%20Era.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Nutrition Policy in the Post-devolution Context in Pakistan&#58; An Analysis of Provincial Opportunities and Barriers*\u200b</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Nutrition%20-%20Policy%20Brief%20copy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Action on under-nutrition in Pakistan&#58; opportunities and barriers\u200b</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Political%20Economy%20Under-Nutrition%20Balochistan%20Report%20-%20Final%20copy%202.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Nutirition Political Economy, Pakistan\u200b&#58; Balochistan Province Report</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Political%20Economy%20Under%20Nutrition%20KP%20Report%20-%20Final%20copy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bNutirition Political Economy, Pakistan\u200b&#58; Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Province Report</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Political%20Economy%20Under%20Nutrition%20Punjab%20Report%20-%20Final%20copy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Nutirition Political Economy, Pakistan\u200b&#58; Punjab Province Report</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Political%20Economy%20Under%20Nutrition%20Sindh%20Report%20-%20Final%20copy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Nutirition Political Economy, Pakistan\u200b&#58; Sindh Province Report</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/The%20Political%20Economy%20of%20Undernutrition%20%20Pakistan%20copy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">The Political Economy of Undernutirtion&#58; National Report - Pakistan</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Governing%20multisectoral%20action%20for%20health%20in%20low%20and%20middle%20income%20countries.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Governing Multisectoral Action for Health in Low- and Middle-Income Countries\u200b</a>\u200b</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/Documents/Lenses%20and%20levels_%20the%20why,%20what%20and%20how%20of%20measuring%20health%20system.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Lenses and levels&#58; the why, what and how of measuring health system drivers of women\u2019s, children\u2019s and adolescents\u2019 health with a governance focus\u200b</a>\u200b\u200b</p></li></ul></div>",
